# Runtime state, written by the server and specific to one machine: the plate,
# the print log, the Made log and its photos, the saved-design library, the
# geocoder cache and the elevation tile cache. All of it is regenerated on
# demand and none of it belongs to the code.
state/
library/
assets/elev/
cache/
*.3mf
*.gcode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/

# written by tests/run.mjs
result.json
